  "description": "WPF 高效能金融圖表控制項:以 DrawingVisual 分層繪製(不為每根 K 線建立 UIElement),K 線數多於像素時依像素欄位降採樣並保留最高最低,10,000 根 K 線縮放平移維持 60 FPS。提供 K 線、折線(指標、權益曲線)、進出場標記(形狀與文字標示方向,不只靠顏色)、停損停利水平線、時間軸(UTC 資料、依時區顯示)、價格軸(線性與對數)、十字準星與 Tooltip。資料模型的價格一律 decimal,只在換算螢幕座標時轉成 double。零第三方相依。High-performance financial chart control for WPF: layered DrawingVisual rendering, per-pixel-column downsampling that keeps highs and lows, 60 FPS pan and zoom over 10,000 candles. Candlesticks, lines, direction-aware trade markers, price lines, a time axis with time-zone display, linear and logarithmic price axes, crosshair and tooltip. Prices stay decimal until the screen-coordinate conversion. No third-party dependencies.",
